# M-SOV06 -- W2-CA-06 events 55/56. SOV06t: once the Allied fleet houses
# have no ships left, 'AllNavyDestroyed' (event 55 DestroyedUnitsNaval x2)
# fires -> WON. Cheat: the two fleet houses removed (combat skip).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov06t.MAP Nod

until 60 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
until 900 objectives >= 1
wait 900
cheat kill_house 1
cheat kill_house 2
until 1500 outcome == WON
assert outcome == WON
